## 18. Regenerate company instructions after saving Guidelines

When the CEO saves or updates Guidelines:

1. Validate the guideline sections.
2. Save the guideline content.
3. Increment the guideline/configuration version.
4. Use the existing AI API to regenerate the affected compact instructions based on the newly saved rules and current company profile.
5. Preserve company-wide instructions and regenerate role-specific/task-specific sections as required.
6. Validate the output.
7. Persist the updated prompt version.
8. Make it active only when it corresponds to the latest saved company profile and guidelines.
